  "short_description": "<p>Elegant decorative vase made of spun bamboo with MOP inlay – handcrafted in Vietnam, ideal for luxury home and hotel décor. Wholesale available.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"724\">This <strong data-start=\"362\" data-end=\"381\">decorative vase</strong> is a stunning combination of traditional Vietnamese <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"463\">spun bamboo craftsmanship</strong> and the refined elegance of <strong data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"523\">mother-of-pearl (MOP) inlay</strong>. Carefully handcrafted by skilled artisans, the vase features a smooth bamboo base shaped using spinning techniques, then adorned with hand-applied MOP shells to create shimmering, intricate patterns.</p>\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"932\">Perfect as a home accent, tabletop centerpiece, or hospitality décor, this vase is lightweight yet durable, blending natural beauty with luxury. It’s suitable for dried flowers or as a standalone art piece.</p>\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"1121\">As a direct <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"985\">manufacturer and wholesale exporter</strong> in Vietnam, <strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1029\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong> offers <strong data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1062\">OEM/ODM customization</strong>, eco-friendly packaging, and bulk supply to global buyers.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1150\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1150\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<li data-start=\"1151\" data-end=\"1205\">\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1205\">Handmade from spun bamboo – lightweight and strong</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1263\">\n<p data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1263\">Exterior decorated with natural mother-of-pearl inlay</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1304\">\n<p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1304\">Elegant, modern, and cultural appeal</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1363\">\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1363\">Suitable for home, hotel, restaurant, or gallery décor</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1419\">\n<p data-start=\"1366\" data-end=\"1419\">Available in multiple sizes, patterns, and finishes</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1470\">Sustainable, biodegradable, and ethically made</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1475\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1504\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1502\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1552\">By choosing this handcrafted vase, you support:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1857\">\n<li data-start=\"1554\" data-end=\"1603\">\n<p data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1603\"><strong data-start=\"1556\" data-end=\"1601\">Vietnamese artisans and rural communities</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1678\">\n<p data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1678\"><strong data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1631\">Cultural preservation</strong> of traditional spinning and inlay techniques</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1679\" data-end=\"1739\">\n<p data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1739\"><strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1707\">Sustainable production</strong> using 100% domestic materials</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1740\" data-end=\"1799\">\n<p data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1799\"><strong data-start=\"1742\" data-end=\"1769\">Export value generation</strong> for Vietnam’s craft economy</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1800\" data-end=\"1857\">\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1857\"><strong data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1857\">Plastic-free and eco-conscious home décor solutions</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"2010\">At <strong data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1893\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we take pride in being your trusted <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1977\">factory, manufacturer, and global supplier</strong> of handcrafted home accessories.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"2012\" data-end=\"2015\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2051\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2049\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2143\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2085\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2085\" data-end=\"2088\" />🌐 Website: <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2143\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2189\" data-end=\"2333\">",
